# Local DNS records for mancave.lab, served by the Pi-hole LXC (vmid 103, 192.168.50.5).
# One record per line: "<ip> <hostname>". Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Source of truth: this file. Pi-hole v6 reads from /etc/pihole/pihole.toml's dns.hosts array,
# not /etc/pihole/custom.list. See README.md for the one-liner that pushes this file into
# dns.hosts via pihole-FTL --config.
#
# Edits made in the admin UI (Settings → Local DNS Records) write to pihole.toml directly and
# will be overwritten the next time this file is deployed.

